01:04:26,666 --> 01:04:32,666
Materialists is a 2025 American romantic drama film
written and directed by Celine Song.

11
01:10:53,333 --> 01:10:59,333
The film stars Dakota Johnson, Chris Evans, and Pedro Pascal.

12
01:17:20,000 --> 01:17:26,000
Explores a love triangle between a matchmaker, her ex-boyfriend who dreams of being an actor,
and a wealthy playboy surrounded by New York City's money-obsessed dating scene.

13
01:23:46,666 --> 01:23:52,666
Song's second directorial effort after Past Lives (2023), Materialists continues many of her previous
film's themes regarding intimacy, identity and relationships with people in the modern world.

14
01:30:13,333 --> 01:30:19,333
Produced by Killer Films and 2AM, Materialists was distributed by A24 in the
United States and received a limited release on June 13, 2025.

15
01:36:40,000 --> 01:36:46,000
Distributed internationally by Sony Pictures Releasing International, the film received positive reviews from critics and grossed $108 million worldwide,
making it A24's third highest-grossing film of all time, the highest-grossing independent film of 2025 and Song's highest-grossing film to date.

16
01:43:06,666 --> 01:43:12,666
The film explores themes of new york city, love triangle, wedding, class
differences, ex-boyfriend ex-girlfriend relationship.

17
01:49:33,333 --> 01:49:39,333
The tone is emotional and thought_provoking.
